{"page":64,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:109","surah":3,"ayah":109,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَإِلَى ٱللَّهِ تُرْجَعُ ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Everything in the heavens and earth belongs to God; it is to Him that all things return.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"And to Allah (belongs)","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِلَى","en_gloss":"And to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تُرْجَعُ","en_gloss":"will be returned","transliteration":"tur'jaʿu","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_gloss":"the matters","transliteration":"l-umūru","verse_key":"3:109"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٠٩","en_gloss":"(109)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:109"}]},{"verse_key":"3:110","surah":3,"ayah":110,"ar_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ خَيْرَ أُمَّةٍ أُخْرِجَتْ لِلنَّاسِ تَأْمُرُونَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَتَنْهَوْنَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنكَرِ وَتُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ ۗ وَلَوْ ءَامَنَ أَهْلُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ لَكَانَ خَيْرًا لَّهُم ۚ مِّنْهُمُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ وَأَكْثَرُهُمُ ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Believers], you are the best community singled out for people: you order what is right, forbid what is wrong, and believe in God. If the People of the Book had also believed, it would have been better for them. For although some of them do believe, most of them are lawbreakers-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"You are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَيْرَ","en_gloss":"(the) best","transliteration":"khayra","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُمَّةٍ","en_gloss":"(of) people","transliteration":"ummatin","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُخْرِجَتْ","en_gloss":"raised","transliteration":"ukh'rijat","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for the mankind ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَأْمُرُونَ","en_gloss":"enjoining","transliteration":"tamurūna","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","en_gloss":"the right","transliteration":"bil-maʿrūfi","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَتَنْهَوْنَ","en_gloss":"and forbidding","transliteration":"watanhawna","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمُنكَرِ","en_gloss":"the wrong","transliteration":"l-munkari","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَتُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"and believing","transliteration":"watu'minūna","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ءَامَنَ","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmana","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَهْلُ","en_gloss":"(the) People","transliteration":"ahlu","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَكَانَ","en_gloss":"surely would have been","transliteration":"lakāna","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":18,"ar":"خَيْرًۭا","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"khayran","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَّهُم ۚ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"3:110"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِّنْهُمُ","en_gloss":"Among them"