3:112","surah":3,"ayah":112,"ar_uthmani":"ضُرِبَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلذِّلَّةُ أَيْنَ مَا ثُقِفُوٓا۟ إِلَّا بِحَبْلٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَحَبْلٍ مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ وَبَآءُو بِغَضَبٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَضُرِبَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْمَسْكَنَةُ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ يَكْفُرُونَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَيَقْتُلُونَ ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ بِغَيْرِ حَقٍّ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ بِمَا عَصَوا۟ وَّكَانُوا۟ يَعْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and, unless they hold fast to a lifeline from God and from mankind, they are overshadowed by vulnerability wherever they are found. They have drawn God’s wrath upon themselves. They are overshadowed by weakness, too, because they have persistently disbelieved in God’s revelation and killed prophets without any right, all because of their disobedience and boundless transgression.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ضُرِبَتْ","en_gloss":"Struck","transliteration":"ḍuribat","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلذِّلَّةُ","en_gloss":"the humiliation","transliteration":"l-dhilatu","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَيْنَ","en_gloss":"wherever","transliteration":"ayna","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ثُقِفُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they are found","transliteration":"thuqifū","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِحَبْلٍۢ","en_gloss":"with a rope","transliteration":"biḥablin","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَحَبْلٍۢ","en_gloss":"and a rope","transliteration":"waḥablin","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:112"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l