"transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:114"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_gloss":"the righteous","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","verse_key":"3:114"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١١٤","en_gloss":"(114)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:114"}]},{"verse_key":"3:115","surah":3,"ayah":115,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا يَفْعَلُوا۟ مِنْ خَيْرٍ فَلَن يُكْفَرُوهُ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌۢ بِٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and they will not be denied [the reward] for whatever good deeds they do: God knows exactly who is conscious of Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَفْعَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they do","transliteration":"yafʿalū","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَيْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"a good","transliteration":"khayrin","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَلَن","en_gloss":"then never","transliteration":"falan","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُكْفَرُوهُ ۗ","en_gloss":"will they be denied it","transliteration":"yuk'farūhu","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_gloss":"of the God-fearing","transliteration":"bil-mutaqīna","verse_key":"3:115"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١١٥","en_gloss":"(115)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:115"}]}]}